   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "On the night of her trip Kovac left Vienna at 21:40 and was asleep before Graz. The attendant, a retired schoolteacher named Pavel Horak, had made up her bunk with a wool blanket and left a bottle of water and a card with the breakfast hours. He said the youngest passengers were the most grateful, because they had never travelled any other way than by plane.",
